WEBVTT

00:09:59.371 --> 00:10:01.496
that I probably won't become old,

00:10:01.537 --> 00:10:03.079
like really old,

00:10:03.121 --> 00:10:06.329
the kind of old everyone else dreads
and tries to fight against.

00:10:07.329 --> 00:10:09.954
I would've made a great old person.

00:10:11.287 --> 00:10:12.537
My grief --

00:10:13.329 --> 00:10:14.704
it's big.

00:10:16.037 --> 00:10:19.371
My fear of dying,
of leaving behind the people I love.

00:10:19.412 --> 00:10:21.079
It's enormous.

00:10:22.662 --> 00:10:26.537
And my work photographing death
has not erased that.

00:10:27.621 --> 00:10:29.871
Death itself is rarely beautiful

00:10:29.912 --> 00:10:32.954
and the images I capture reflect that too.